WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.041
Set your project id and your project API key as environment variables,

2
00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:09.349
then run the same upload command without the dry-run flag.

3
00:00:09.399 --> 00:00:14.962
Only the manifest, the screenshots and a layout tree for each screen are sent,

4
00:00:15.012 --> 00:00:16.985
never your source code.

5
00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:21.750
When the upload is accepted, the command prints the build number.

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.672
The key shown here is a placeholder.

